  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Want to know about Carolina University? It’s a private, Christ-centred institution located in Winston‑Salem, North Carolina. The college offers you several undergraduate and postgraduate courses to choose from.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Carolina University, your student life will be filled with a mix of spiritual growth, athletics, leadership initiatives, and small-class engagement. Through this, you’ll get a personalised learning experience.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>At Carolina University, you can choose from four dormitory options on campus. You’ll get multiple amenities, lounge areas, and student activities offered multiple times a week.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Sports</strong><br>If you’re into sports, you can choose from 11 varsity sports, including baseball, basketball, soccer, volleyball, and more. The university also competes in the NCCAA Division I sports.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll find several labs across different departments, including the Department of Biology, the College of Health and Human Performance, and the School of the Earth, Ocean &amp; Environment. These include the Environmental Research Laboratory (ERL), Textile Lab, and more.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You’ll find a lot of on-campus dining options, including the dining facilities at the Chase Hall of residence. Additionally, you’ll also find various cafes, eateries, and restaurants nearby.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
